<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>THE VOID — Tu n'es pas seul</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Creepster&family=Special+Elite&display=swap');

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

html, body {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100%;
}

body {
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, #160707 0%, #050505 45%, #000 100%);
    color: #ddd;
    font-family: "Special Elite", monospace;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    cursor: none;
}

/* Curseur */

.cursor {
    position: fixed;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #b40000;
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 9999;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #900;
}

/* Bruit vidéo */

.noise {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1000;
    opacity: .07;
    background-image:
        repeating-radial-gradient(
            circle at 0 0,
            #fff 0,
            #fff 1px,
            transparent 1px,
            transparent 3px
        );
    background-size: 5px 5px;
    animation: noise .15s infinite;
}

@keyframes noise {
    0% { transform: translate(0,0); }
    25% { transform: translate(2px,-1px); }
    50% { transform: translate(-1px,2px); }
    75% { transform: translate(1px,1px); }
    100% { transform: translate(-2px,-1px); }
}

/* Vignette */

.vignette {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 999;
    box-shadow:
        inset 0 0 180px #000,
        inset 0 0 350px #000;
}

/* Navigation */

nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 25px 6%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(#000, transparent);
}

.logo {
    font-family: "Creepster", cursive;
    font-size: 34px;
    color: #9c0000;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px #500;
}

nav button {
    background: transparent;
    color: #aaa;
    border: none;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: none;
    transition: .3s;
}

nav button:hover {
    color: #d00000;
}

/* Hero */

.hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px;
    position: relative;
}

.hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 300px;
    height: 500px;
    background: rgba(110,0,0,.12);
    filter: blur(90px);
    animation: pulse 5s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse {
    0%,100% { opacity: .2; transform: scale(.8); }
    50% { opacity: .7; transform: scale(1.1); }
}

.content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
}

.warning {
    color: #8d0000;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    animation: blink 2s infinite;
}

@keyframes blink {
    0%, 90%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    95% { opacity: .15; }
}

h1 {
    font-family: "Creepster", cursive;
    font-size: clamp(80px, 15vw, 190px);
    font-weight: normal;
    letter-spacing: 10px;
    color: #eee;
    text-shadow:
        4px 4px 0 #500,
        0 0 30px #500;
    animation: glitch 4s infinite;
}

@keyframes glitch {
    0%, 90%, 100% {
        transform: translate(0);
    }

    91% {
        transform: translate(-5px, 2px);
    }

    92% {
        transform: translate(5px, -2px);
    }

    93% {
        transform: translate(-2px, 0);
    }
}

.subtitle {
    margin: 10px auto 40px;
    max-width: 600px;
    color: #888;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 15px;
}

.enter {
    border: 1px solid #700;
    background: rgba(20,0,0,.5);
    color: #ddd;
    padding: 17px 45px;
    font-family: inherit;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    cursor: none;
    transition: .4s;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(100,0,0,.2);
}

.enter:hover {
    background: #650000;
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px #700;
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

/* Sections */

section {
    padding: 100px 8%;
    border-top: 1px solid #180000;
}

.section-title {
    font-family: "Creepster", cursive;
    font-size: 50px;
    color: #a00000;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
}

.cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.card {
    min-height: 220px;
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid #251010;
    background:
        linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(30,0,0,.5), rgba(0,0,0,.8));
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: .4s;
}

.card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: #700;
    left: -100%;
    bottom: 0;
    transition: .5s;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    border-color: #650000;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(100,0,0,.2);
}

.card:hover::after {
    left: 0;
}

.card span {
    font-size: 40px;
}

.card h3 {
    color: #b00000;
    margin: 20px 0 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.card p {
    color: #777;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 13px;
}

/* Message */

.message {
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
}

.message p {
    color: #555;
    margin: 15px;
}

.secret {
    color: #7c0000 !important;
    font-size: 20px;
    min-height: 30px;
}

/* Footer */

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 50px;
    color: #333;
    border-top: 1px solid #100000;
}

footer strong {
    color: #760000;
}

/* Apparition */

.ghost {
    position: fixed;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    inset: 0;
    background:
        radial-gradient(
            ellipse at center,
            rgba(255,255,255,.08),
            rgba(0,0,0,.98) 55%
        );
    z-index: 500;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.ghost-face {
    width: 120px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50% 50% 40% 40%;
    background: #111;
    box-shadow: 0 0 50px #000;
    position: relative;
}

.ghost-face::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 22px;
    height: 32px;
    background: #ddd;
    border-radius: 50%;
    left: 25px;
    top: 55px;
    box-shadow: 48px 0 #ddd;
}

.ghost-face::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 25px;
    height: 45px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #000;
    left: 48px;
    top: 100px;
}

.show-ghost {
    display: flex;
    animation: ghostAppear .6s forwards;
}

@keyframes ghostAppear {
    0% { opacity: 0; }
    40% { opacity: 1; }
    60% { opacity: .2; }
    100% { opacity: 1; }
}

/* Terminal */

.terminal {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 20px;
    width: 300px;
    padding: 15px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.9);
    border: 1px solid #250000;
    color: #600;
    font-size: 11px;
    z-index: 50;
    opacity: .7;
}

/* Mobile */

@media(max-width:900px) {
    .cards {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
}

@media(max-width:600px) {
    .cards {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    nav {
        padding: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 75px;
    }

    .terminal {
        display: none;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="noise"></div>
<div class="vignette"></div>

<div class="cursor" id="cursor"></div>

<nav>
    <div class="logo">THE VOID</div>

    <button onclick="randomEvent()">
        [ NE PAS CLIQUER ]
    </button>
</nav>

<main>

    <section class="hero">

        <div class="content">

            <div class="warning">
                ⚠ ACCÈS NON RECOMMANDÉ ⚠
            </div>

            <h1>THE VOID</h1>

            <p class="subtitle">
                Certains endroits devraient rester oubliés.<br>
                Certaines histoires ne devraient jamais être racontées.
            </p>

            <button class="enter" onclick="enterVoid()">
                ENTRER DANS LE VIDE
            </button>

        </div>

    </section>


    <section>

        <h2 class="section-title">
            Archives interdites
        </h2>

        <div class="cards">

            <div class="card">
                <span>☠</span>
                <h3>EXPÉRIENCES</h3>
                <p>
                    Des expériences étranges menées dans des endroits
                    où personne ne devrait être.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <span>◉</span>
                <h3>DOCUMENTS</h3>
                <p>
                    Des dossiers retrouvés après la disparition
                    de leurs propriétaires.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <span>♙</span>
                <h3>TÉMOIGNAGES</h3>
                <p>
                    Ils ont raconté ce qu'ils avaient vu.
                    Certains n'ont jamais pu terminer leur histoire.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <span>◌</span>
                <h3>VIDÉOS</h3>
                <p>
                    Des enregistrements étranges récupérés
                    sur des appareils abandonnés.
                </